<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Delia's starts.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Delia's starts.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co has started coverage of Delia's Inc with a rating of outperform, a source at the brokerage said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the retailer of women's clothes through catalogues closed at 17-3/4 on Monday.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
